sequenceDiagram
    actor Patient
    participant Portal as Patient Portal
    participant Auth as Amazon Cognito
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Booking as Test Booking Service
    participant DB as Amazon RDS
    participant Notify as SNS/SES Notification Service

    Patient->>Portal: Sign in
    Portal->>Auth: Authenticate credentials
    Auth-->>Portal: Access token
    Portal-->>Patient: Dashboard
    Patient->>Portal: View recommended tests
    Portal->>API: GET /patients/me/recommended-tests + token
    API->>Booking: Invoke authorized service
    Booking->>DB: Fetch patient's recommended tests
    DB-->>Booking: Test list
    Booking-->>API: Test list
    API-->>Portal: 200 OK
    Portal-->>Patient: Display tests
    Patient->>Portal: Select test and slot
    Portal->>API: POST /bookings
    API->>Booking: Validate request
    Booking->>DB: Check recommendation and slot
    DB-->>Booking: Validation result
    alt Valid and available
        Booking->>DB: Save booking
        DB-->>Booking: Booking ID
        Booking->>Notify: Publish confirmation event
        Notify-->>Patient: Booking confirmation
        Booking-->>API: Booking created
        API-->>Portal: 201 Created
        Portal-->>Patient: Show confirmation
    else Invalid or unavailable
        Booking-->>API: Validation error
        API-->>Portal: 400/409
        Portal-->>Patient: Show error and retry option
    end
